1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
You reach the end of Dark Souls, defeat
Gwyn, and discover the final

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,680
boss was never the real question.

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:09,480
It is whether his world deserves to
continue.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:15,220
Before kingdoms, there were ancient
dragons and a world without change.

5
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:19,720
Then the First Flame appeared, bringing
life and death, light and dark.

6
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:23,660
Gwyn, Nito, and the Witch of Izalith
claimed powerful souls.

7
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:27,980
With Seath's betrayal, they defeated the
dragons and began the Age

8
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:32,100
of Fire. But another being, the Furtive
Pygmy, found the Dark Soul:

9
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:37,280
humanity's inheritance. Eventually, the
flame weakened.

10
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:41,020
Gwyn feared an age where humanity would
replace the gods.

11
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,880
He burned himself to keep the fire alive.

12
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,120
It bought time.

13
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,100
It did not solve the problem.

14
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
By your arrival, Lordran is crumbling.

15
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:55,440
The undead return after death, but many
lose their minds and become

16
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:59,760
Hollows. You escape the Undead Asylum and
reach Firelink Shrine.

17
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:04,440
A prophecy sends you after two bells: one
above, one deep below.

18
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:08,760
Ring both, and the serpent Frampt directs
you towards Anor Londo.

19
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:11,860
Beyond Ornstein and Smough waits the
Lordvessel.

20
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:15,440
To open the way to Gwyn, you must gather
great souls.

21
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:18,240
Nito. Seath. The Four Kings.

22
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:22,580
And the Bed of Chaos, born from the
Witch's failed attempt to recreate

23
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:26,460
the flame. These are the broken remains of
the old order.

24
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:29,800
Frampt calls your sacrifice salvation.

25
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:33,960
But another serpent, Kaathe, offers a
different story: let the fire

26
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:36,800
fade, and humanity can inherit the world.

27
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:38,680
Neither guide is neutral.

28
00:01:40,060 --> 00:01:44,180
At the Kiln, Gwyn fights with a burning
sword, almost everything else

29
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:47,700
spent. Defeat him, and link the fire by
burning yourself.

30
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,400
Or walk away, becoming the Dark Lord.

31
00:01:50,820 --> 00:01:52,900
Dark Souls gives you power to choose.

32
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:55,540
It never gives you certainty.
